  "package.json": "{\n  \"name\": \"viking-project-template\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"workspaces\": [\n    \"apps/*\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"npm run dev -w apps/api & npm run dev -w apps/web\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"npm run typecheck -w apps/api && npm run typecheck -w apps/web\",\n    \"build\": \"npm run build -w apps/api && npm run build -w apps/web\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@types/express\": \"^5.0.6\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"^24.7.2\",\n    \"@types/react\": \"^19.2.17\",\n    \"@types/react-dom\": \"^19.2.3\",\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.23.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.9.3\"\n  }\n}\n",
  "README.md": "# {{PROJECT_NAME}}\n\nGenerated by `vs project create`.\n\n## Commands\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run dev\nnpm run build\n```\n\nThe browser app reads the features selected by `vs project create --features` from `/api/config`. Project IDs and credentials are kept on the API side in `apps/api/src/env.ts`. Generated credentials are plain text; for deployments, prefer overriding them with runtime environment variables.\n\nRuntime authentication overrides:\n\n- `VIKING_API_KEY` for API key authentication\n- `VIKING_AK`, `VIKING_SK`, and optionally `VIKING_REGION` for AK/SK authentication\n\nThe API exposes only the selected feature routes and returns HTTP 404 for disabled features:\n\n- `POST /api/chat` with `{ \"message\": \"question\", \"sessionId\": \"optional-session-id\" }`, returning a `text/event-stream` response\n- `POST /api/search` with `{ \"query\": \"keyword\", \"page\": 1 }`, `{ \"image\": { \"base64\": \"data:image/png;base64,...\" }, \"page\": 1 }`, or both `query` and `image`\n- `POST /api/query-recommendation`, returning recommended search queries in `recommendation_queries`\n- `POST /api/recommend`, returning up to 20 recommendation results\n\nChat responses are streamed as SSE events: `session`, `chunk`, `error`, and `done`.\nSuccessful search responses include pagination metadata from the template API.\nSearch query recommendation responses are returned directly from `@volcengine/search-node`.\nRecommendation responses are returned directly from `@volcengine/search-node`.\n\nDeploy through the CLI with an explicit provider:\n\n```bash\nvs project deploy --provider cloudflare\n```\n",
  "wrangler.jsonc": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"./node_modules/wrangler/config-schema.json\",\n  \"name\": \"{{WORKER_NAME}}\",\n  \"main\": \"./apps/api/src/cloudflare.ts\",\n  \"compatibility_date\": \"{{COMPATIBILITY_DATE}}\",\n  \"compatibility_flags\": [\n    \"nodejs_compat\"\n  ],\n  \"preview_urls\": true,\n  \"assets\": {\n    \"directory\": \"./apps/web/dist\",\n    \"binding\": \"ASSETS\",\n    \"not_found_handling\": \"single-page-application\",\n    \"run_worker_first\": [\n      \"/api/*\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"
